{
  "_doc": [
    "The ratified endpoint-support matrix: provider -> EndpointSupport booleans,",
    "auth modes, and env key conventions, pinned 2026-09-01. tools/audit.py",
    "compares this file against the reference implementation via surface_dump",
    "(HARD check, both directions): a port or the reference silently changing",
    "who supports what is contract drift, not a patch. Widening support lands",
    "here FIRST, with live receipts, like every provider behavior.",
    "2026-09-02: `caches` column added (MAP-6 stored-cache tier); gemini is the first implementer. changes/2026-09-01-caching-design.md",
    "2026-09-03: the six chat-bound registry providers (groq, openrouter, deepseek, ollama, vllm, sglang) are pinned; the reference reflects lm15.registry.PROVIDERS, not only the adapter classes. deepseek's row is declared from provider documentation and awaits its live receipt (research/providers/deepseek/). changes/2026-09-03-provider-registry.md",
    "2026-09-03: zai pinned with live receipts (changes/2026-09-03-zai-live.md).",
    "2026-09-03: deepseek-anthropic pinned (the Messages wire of the same service; models=false \u2014 GET /models is 404 there). changes/2026-09-03-deepseek-anthropic-live.md",
    "2026-09-03: moonshotai (Kimi API Platform, Chat Completions wire) pinned with live receipts; env keys MOONSHOTAI_API_KEY then MOONSHOT_API_KEY (both vendor-named). Files and batches exist on the service (files are for content extraction and vision input; batches take JSONL) and are not registered yet; the Responses and Anthropic wires are separate provider strings to come. changes/2026-09-03-moonshotai-live.md",
    "2026-09-03: moonshotai-responses (Responses wire; kimi-k3 documented, stateless, web_search built-in; the same GET /models) and moonshotai-anthropic (Messages wire, bearer token; GET /models is 404 on the /anthropic root) pinned with live receipts. changes/2026-09-03-moonshotai-wires.md",
    "2026-09-04: bedrock-mantle-chat pinned with live receipts (GET /v1/models 200, 55 ids; gpt-oss and DeepSeek 200). A tenth cloud door; not a rename of bedrock-chat. changes/2026-09-04-bedrock-mantle-chat-live.md",
    "2026-09-04: Azure completion pass extended: azure live=true, files=true, batches=true, speech=true; Realtime text WebSocket, Files pending lifecycle, Batch queue/cancel, WAV speech, gpt-5-mini reasoning, prompt cache hits, and both content-filter paths live-pinned. Images remain false pending gpt-image-1-mini quota; video deliberately excluded. azure-anthropic remains quota-blocked for successful inference, but x-api-key and all Entra paths are live-proven; documented api-key is refused. changes/2026-09-04-azure-live.md, changes/2026-09-04-azure-anthropic-partial.md"
  ],
